$NetBSD$

Use cmp for the six file-equality tests in GNU diffutils 3.12.
The tests consume only exit status. Preserve each redirection and branch.
This lets a checked cmp bootstrap diff without an existing diff program.
Keep the grep and sed capability tests; do not preseed their cache results.

Guard the optional Automake xargs test when the tool is absent.
Keep its complete original capability test when xargs is present.
Use the upstream no branch for absence; do not run a missing program.
Local AI-assisted EmberBSD change. Not submitted upstream.

